      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so my doctor just started me on a new med for my depression (an MAOI thing?) and i'm trying to get my diet on track. i want to go high protein to help with my energy. is it cool if i keep eating stuff like aged cheddar, deli meats, and soy sauce? just wanna make sure i'm eating healthy while on this stuff.",
