      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Precise dietary restrictions with MAOIs are necessary because even foods like deli turkey and products that contain standard soy sauce might still be contaminated with substances that can interfere with your medication. It’s really important to follow the guidance of your healthcare provider regarding meal planning with MAOIs. Those precautionary measures aren't just about the food but protecting your overall health and ensuring the effectiveness of your treatment. Let's work together to find practical solutions that fit your lifestyle without compromising your safety.",
